  {
    "index": 3,
    "hash": "5Kovzi93kG3QlRYyzoNJ4gHSndQ=",
    "timestampUtcMs": "2026-09-03T07:54:34.758Z",
    "action": {
      "type": "SET_CONTENT",
      "input": {
        "content": "`03-Build/05-Launch/03-SetupEnvironment.md` is the VM/server deployment guide, and its central step is:\n\n```bash\nph service setup     # then: ph service status | start | stop | restart\n```\n\nAt v6.2.2-dev.74 that command is **not dispatchable**. `packages/shared/clis/command-names.ts` hardcodes the list ph-cmd forwards \u2014 `generate`, `vetra`, `connect`, `build`, `publish`, `list`/`l`, `access-token`, `registry-login`, `inspect`/`is`, `migrate`, `switchboard`, `reactor`, `login`, `logout`, `install`/`add`/`i`, `uninstall`/`remove` \u2014 and **`service` is absent**, even though `clis/ph-cli/src/commands/service.ts` still exists in the tree.\n\nSo everything the guide promises through that one command is currently unreachable as written: Nginx installed as a reverse proxy with WebSocket-aware configuration and security headers, SSL via Let's Encrypt or a self-signed certificate, PM2 for process management with restart-on-crash and start-on-boot, a local or remote PostgreSQL choice, and package installation prompts.\n\nWhat in the page **is** still usable: the machine prerequisites (Linux, sudo, at least 1 GB RAM and 10 GB disk, a registered domain with subdomains for Connect and Switchboard), the cloud-provider walkthroughs for a DigitalOcean droplet or an AWS elastic IP with DNS, and the installer `curl -fsSL https://apps.powerhouse.io/install | bash` followed by `ph --version`.\n\nThe page's own tip names the alternative: choose Docker for the fastest path to production, direct installation for maximum control \u2014 and the Docker path is the one whose commands still exist.\n\n## Provenance\n- `apps/academy/docs/academy/03-Build/05-Launch/03-SetupEnvironment.md` \u2014 1. Setting up a new cloud environment \u203a Installation and Service configuration; 2. Verifying the setup\n\n_Extracted from the Powerhouse repository at **v6.2.2-dev.74**._",
        "updatedAt": "2026-09-03T07:54:34.758Z"
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-09-03T07:54:34.758Z"
    }
  },
